sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task (trigger automatic, gateway-release) + single-swamp-node + gateway-recovery runtime handoff; DECISIONS round 2 bug fix (terminate when active=true, start when false; one test per branch).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=caller tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Gateway Node<br/>reached over ssh
  Note over GW: Release handoff, serve<br/>gateway:release:handoff
  Note over GW: Render the Horizon unit<br/>task #5132 · Process 418
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-process-horizon-handoff
  SW->>N: Copy scripts, inspect<br/>@swamp/ssh · inspect.py
  N-->>SW: unit hash, active state
  opt unit content differs
    SW->>N: Stage and verify unit<br/>systemd-analyze verify
    SW->>N: Publish, reload, enable<br/>systemctl daemon-reload, enable
  end
  opt Horizon was active
    SW->>N: Hand off to new release<br/>horizon:terminate
  end
  opt Horizon was not active
    SW->>N: Start Horizon<br/>systemctl start
  end
  SW->>N: Verify the unit runs<br/>systemctl is-active --quiet
  alt Horizon is active
    N-->>SW: active
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · result
    Note over GW: Process active<br/>store systemd_activation_hash
  else a step fails
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
    Note over GW: Process failed<br/>task → failed
  end
